## 6. Feature Engineering

### 6.1 Property Features

The project examines selected property characteristics:

- Bedrooms
- Bathrooms
- Living area
- Grade
- Year built

### 6.2 Sale Year

The `date` column is converted into a datetime format to extract the sale year.

### 6.3 Property Age

The age of a property at the time of sale is calculated by subtracting the year built from the sale year.

### 6.4 Renovation Status

A new column named `is_renovated` is created to classify properties as renovated or not renovated based on the `yr_renovated` value.

### 6.5 Years Since Renovation

The project calculates the number of years between renovation and sale for properties with a recorded renovation year.

### 6.6 Price per Square Foot

Two additional features are created:

- `price_per_sqft_living` – House price divided by living area.
- `price_per_sqft_lot` – House price divided by lot area.

These features help compare prices relative to property size.

